","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"not_legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}","name":"Universal Automaton","oracle_id":"d50b1d2e-1825-432a-ab73-068fdc356f50","oracle_text":"Changeling (This card is every creature type.)","power":"1","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2019-06-14","toughness":"1","type_line":"Artifact Creature \u2014 Shapeshifter"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{U}","name":"Unsummon","oracle_id":"837182db-1bf3-4a2c-bd01-1af9d9873561","oracle_text":"Return target creature to its owner's hand.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-04-24","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Any enters abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Clone enters. Any \"as [this creature] enters\" or \"[this creature] enters with\" abilities of the chosen creature will also work.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Clone copies exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn't copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Clone's ability doesn't target the chosen creature.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If Clone somehow enters at the same time as another creature, Clone can't become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that's already on the battlefield.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature is a token, Clone copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is an Evil Twin), then Clone enters as whatever that creature copied.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can choose not to copy anything. In that case, Clone enters as a 0/0 Shapeshifter creature, and is probably put into the graveyard immediately.","oracle_id":"42226b87-0746-4ebf-9fd0-108d508462af","published_at":"2025-10-02","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a creature has more than one creature type, and one of those types matches the creature you are calculating for, then count that creature. Only one type needs to match in order to get counted.","oracle_id":"5f7f133e-58ea-41ab-b1be-be4b400fac4c","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If you have a creature with more than one creature type, count all creatures which have either creature type.","oracle_id":"5f7f133e-58ea-41ab-b1be-be4b400fac4c","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Sharing multiple creature types doesn't give an additional bonus. Coat of Arms counts creatures, not creature types.","oracle_id":"5f7f133e-58ea-41ab-b1be-be4b400fac4c","published_at":"2009-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Alpha Status counts each creature once if that creature shares at least one creature type with the enchanted creature.","oracle_id":"839fb071-6585-4f3e-a13e-1c14779b401a","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The bonus is only +1/+1 per applicable creature, even if it shares more than one creature type with the equipped creature. For example, if the equipped creature is a Human Shaman and you control a Human Warrior, a Goblin Shaman, and another Human Shaman, the equipped creature will get +3/+3.","oracle_id":"83db5c28-e172-4a4d-9324-ed5ade5255bc","published_at":"2016-01-22","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The bonus will change as the creatures you control change. This may cause the equipped creature to lose toughness and die because of damage dealt earlier in the turn.","oracle_id":"83db5c28-e172-4a4d-9324-ed5ade5255bc","published_at":"2016-01-22","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that's untapped or one you already control.","oracle_id":"9d08af23-9f4a-4097-9abc-3b17475ab744","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Gaining control of a creature doesn't cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.","oracle_id":"9d08af23-9f4a-4097-9abc-3b17475ab744","published_at":"2019-07-12","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This is not modal. If the target changes from an artifact to an enchantment or vice versa, this still destroys it.","oracle_id":"a7e97fa9-4b72-4548-b854-5be5f18a6f1a","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
